.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/pause-resume-and-fault-tolerance/resume-after-pause-sentinel-removal.md:19:A pause only helps if the workflow can resume cleanly from the current iteration boundary after the sentinel is cleared.
