.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/state-management/rejected-pattern-cache.md:27:Candidate filtering checks exact normalized text first, then applies category-compatible fuzzy matching using `rejectedPatternFuzzyThreshold` when present. The auto workflow consults reducer-derived `rejectedPatterns`, `rejectedPatternIndex`, and `suppressedCandidates` before next-focus, recovery, or ideas-backed candidates are dispatched.
